   "body": "Not reproducible any more: the operator confirmed on 2026-11-10 (about 16:30 UTC, in the orchestrator's session) that signatures show with the setting on. The child `cloud/i723-sonnet` traced every stage on dev-swift `7847acc` and found each one correct (report on #368). The earlier device build most likely predated LOT-106 (#460) or a later reader fix. The dashes the operator now sees before signatures are #755.\n\n·/·r·elease cloud/i723-sonnet\n\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Claude's GitHub safety filter added the `·` characters above so that a bot command in this comment does not run automatically. A person who wants it to run can post the command without the `·` characters.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
